WEBVTT

00:00:01.244 --> 00:00:03.060
This is a clip made in Fablecut.

00:00:03.919 --> 00:00:06.040
In the next minute,
you will make one like it.

00:00:08.954 --> 00:00:10.125
Start in the library.

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:13.820
Search for what you need,
and every asset shows you

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:14.620
what it draws.

00:00:18.401 --> 00:00:19.912
Open one in the playground.

00:00:20.751 --> 00:00:23.617
Change a parameter,
and the preview follows at once.

00:00:27.806 --> 00:00:28.797
Add it to a clip.

00:00:29.651 --> 00:00:32.162
Drag it on the timeline,
and trim it to fit.

00:00:37.929 --> 00:00:38.729
Then render.

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:42.450
The studio checks the file
it made, from loudness

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:43.475
to frozen frames.

00:00:46.794 --> 00:00:48.450
Find, tune, place, render.

00:00:49.344 --> 00:00:51.565
Open the studio,
and make your first clip.

